<article class="ltx_document">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Zero-source LLM Hallucination Detection with Human-like Criteria Probing</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Jiahao Yang
