                <span id="alg2.l6.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> Aggregate scores via Eqn. (</span><a href="#S4.E6" title="Equation 6 ‣ 4.5 Robust Inference via Multi-sampling Aggregation ‣ 4 Method ‣ Zero-source LLM Hallucination Detection with Human-like Criteria Probing" class="ltx_ref" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a><span id="alg2.l6.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">);
